  id: socket
  title: 5. The Dog Has the Password
  region: Half-Price Horizon Salvage
  briefing: Suzuki has discovered three locked data caches while searching for a
    missing socket. Reach each cache, interact to open it, then extract.
  opening: 'Mara: Suzuki brought me a ten-millimeter socket and the security director''s
    access fob. She is being promoted to accounts receivable.'
  midpoint: 'Bea: The fob opens the cooling-grid control network. Suzuki has also
    opened someone''s lunch. Both are time-sensitive.'
  closing: 'Mara: We know their plan now. They will meter shade, cooling and road
    access as one subscription. Suzuki has requested a biscuit.'
  optionalObjective: Recover 2 roadside salvage caches
